#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD1445 expect=noViolation domain=VS
#note "Every 'Y' row's tuple is unique (distinct VSTESTCD); the PULSE pair differs on the target value (Y vs blank = distinct tuples, and the blank row fails the equality conjunct)."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset VS class=FINDINGS
col STUDYID  type=Char
col DOMAIN   type=Char
col USUBJID  type=Char
col VSSEQ    type=Num
col VSTESTCD type=Char
col VSTSTDTL type=Char
col VSLOBXFL type=Char
---
S1 | VS | 001 | 1 | SYSBP | REST | Y
S1 | VS | 001 | 2 | TEMP  | REST | Y
S1 | VS | 001 | 3 | PULSE | REST | Y
S1 | VS | 001 | 4 | PULSE | REST |
